# BioBand Audio Rules

## Libraries
- Instrument sound: `react-native-audio-api` through the single shared
  `AudioContext` in `src/audio/sampleBank.ts` — never create a second context
- Microphone takes and backing tracks: `expo-audio` (never `expo-av`)

## Timing
- Notes ride the audio clock: schedule with an absolute `context.currentTime`
  start via `src/audio/songScheduler.ts`, never by firing a sound from
  `setTimeout`
- Offline export renders at the live context's sample rate, so decoded
  buffers keep their pitch

## Recording
- Instrument takes are note events `{ note, timestamp, velocity }[]`, rendered
  offline on export; microphone capture is only for mic takes
- Persist with `src/storage/*` (AsyncStorage + expo-file-system)

## Performance
- Bundled samples only; keep each repitch within about two semitones
- Test latency on a real device with a development build
